# SEARCH - Find text or bytes in files

```text
SEARCH "pattern" filespec [options]
```

## Text search

Keep the quotes around the pattern. /NOCASE ignores letter case. /NOHEX
limits the search to text. The result identifies each matching file and
line.

```text
B0:SEARCH "error" D0:*.TXT /NOCASE /NOHEX
```

## Byte search

/NOTEXT interprets the pattern as hexadecimal bytes. Byte matches report
file offsets. A drive/user selector can cover a range of users.

```text
B0:SEARCH "41 42" D[1-3]:*.COM /NOTEXT
```

Use [DUMP](DUMP.HLP) to inspect bytes around a match.
